{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "modulo-audit",
  "title": "Modulo · 日志用量核验",
  "description": "Prometheus Remote Write 的批次快照：调用、覆盖率和同集合差额。",
  "tags": [
    "modulo",
    "audit"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "scope",
        "label": "统计范围",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(modulo_snapshot_timestamp_seconds, scope)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "platform",
        "label": "供应商",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(modulo_calls{scope=~\"$scope\"}, platform)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "日志模型名",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(modulo_calls{scope=~\"$scope\",platform=~\"$platform\"}, model)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "如何阅读",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "每个 scope 展示所选时间范围内最近一次导出的快照；不是日志发生时间的流量曲线。采样结果中的调用数、复算／比较覆盖率和差异率都只针对样本；下方“总体覆盖率”才使用买方本地的候选总数。共享 usage 的 Run 整组抽取，抽样单位数可能小于调用数。\n\n只导出样本时，原始规模、读取状态、抽样比例和总体覆盖率不提供。额度不足或抽样范围不完整时不发送新快照，注意结果时间。切换导出策略不会删除接收方已经保存的历史数据。\n\n输入、输出分别统计；分母为零显示无数据。差额 = 报告 token − 本地 token，只合计同一可比较集合。原文、抽样依据和精确整数留在买方本地。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "结果距今多久（整个 scope）",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "无可用数据"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - last_over_time(modulo_result_timestamp_seconds{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range])",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{scope}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "最近导出距今多久（整个 scope）",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "无可用数据"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "time() - last_over_time(modulo_snapshot_timestamp_seconds{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range])",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{scope}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "本批读取是否完成（整个 scope）",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "只导出样本时不提供；不把接收方旧快照的总体信息当成当前数据。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无可用数据",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "未读完",
                  "color": "orange"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "已读完",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(last_over_time(modulo_batch_read_complete{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range])) and on(scope) (last_over_time(modulo_sample_only{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range]) == 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{scope}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "处理状态（整个 scope）",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "只导出样本时不提供；不把接收方旧快照的总体信息当成当前数据。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无可用数据"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(last_over_time(modulo_run_status{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range]) == 1) and on(scope) (last_over_time(modulo_sample_only{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range]) == 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "原始记录（整个 scope）",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "description": "只导出样本时不提供；不把接收方旧快照的总体信息当成当前数据。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "无可用数据"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "(last_over_time(modulo_source_records{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range])) and on(scope) (last_over_time(modulo_sample_only{scope=~\"$scope\"}[$__range]) == 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
